{"seq":2,"slug":"the-universal-machine","title":"通用图灵机与计算的极限","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/core-contributions/the-turing-machine/the-universal-machine","wordCount":1676,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"通用图灵机与计算的极限\">通用图灵机与计算的极限</h1><p>如果说图灵机定义了&quot;什么是计算&quot;，那么图灵在同一篇 1936 年论文里走出的第二步，才真正惊世骇俗：他证明了存在一台单一的图灵机，能够模拟所有其它图灵机。这台机器被称为&quot;通用图灵机&quot;（Universal Turing Machine, UTM）。它不是为某个特定任务定制的，而是一台&quot;读程序的机器&quot;——你把另一台机器的描述当作数据喂给它，它就照着跑。这正是今天每一台可编程计算机背后的核心思想：硬件固定，行为由软件决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>普通图灵机的&quot;程序&quot;硬连在它的转移表里，换一个任务就得换一台机器。图灵的洞见是：既然每台图灵机都能被有限地写成一张符号表，那这张表本身就能编码成纸带上的一串符号。于是可以造一台机器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span>，它的输入是&quot;另一台机器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 的编码 + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 的输入&quot;，它的工作就是一步步解读并执行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  IN[纸带输入&lt;br/&gt;编码 ⟨M⟩ + 数据 w] --&gt; U[通用机 U&lt;br/&gt;读规则 模拟一步 重复]&#10;  U --&gt; SIM[逐步模拟 M 在 w 上的运行]&#10;  SIM --&gt; OUT[输出 M 在 w 上会产生的结果]&#10;  PROG[任意机器 M 的描述] -.作为数据.-&gt; IN\">flowchart TD\n  IN[纸带输入&lt;br/&gt;编码 ⟨M⟩ + 数据 w] --&gt; U[通用机 U&lt;br/&gt;读规则 模拟一步 重复]\n  U --&gt; SIM[逐步模拟 M 在 w 上的运行]\n  SIM --&gt; OUT[输出 M 在 w 上会产生的结果]\n  PROG[任意机器 M 的描述] -.作为数据.-&gt; IN</pre><p>用一个公式概括它的行为：对任意机器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 和输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U(\\langle M \\rangle, w) = M(w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle M \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 的编码。这一行等式就是&quot;存储程序计算机&quot;的数学原型。对照来看：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>普通图灵机</th>\n<th>通用图灵机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>程序的位置</td>\n<td>焊死在转移表里</td>\n<td>放在纸带上，作为数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改变任务</td>\n<td>必须换一台机器</td>\n<td>换一段输入即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现代对应物</td>\n<td>专用电路（如计算器）</td>\n<td>通用 CPU + 软件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哲学意义</td>\n<td>&quot;一台机器一件事&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;一台机器，万千行为&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;程序即数据&quot;这一转变看似只是一次编码技巧，实则带来了几重连锁后果。把这些后果与它们在工程上的落地对照起来，就能看清通用机为何是计算史上的分水岭：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论后果</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>工程落地</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>程序可被当作数据传递</td>\n<td>机器能读取并执行任意一段描述</td>\n<td>存储程序计算机、可加载程序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬件与行为解耦</td>\n<td>同一台机器可扮演无穷多种身份</td>\n<td>一台 CPU 跑所有软件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模拟的链条可无限嵌套</td>\n<td>通用机可模拟&quot;另一台通用机&quot;</td>\n<td>虚拟机、解释器、模拟器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语法处理与语义执行分离</td>\n<td>机器只认编码，不关心内容含义</td>\n<td>编译器、JIT、字节码解释</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行的&quot;无限嵌套&quot;尤其值得留意：既然通用机 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 本身也是一台图灵机，它当然也能被别的通用机模拟——这就是今天虚拟化与容器技术能层层叠加的理论依据。图灵在 1936 年写下的那行等式，实际上为七十年后&quot;在虚拟机里跑虚拟机&quot;这种工程实践留好了位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"程序即数据-通用性的关键\">程序即数据：通用性的关键</h2><p>通用机最深刻的一点，是它抹平了&quot;程序&quot;与&quot;数据&quot;的界限。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 的规则表在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 眼里只是一段需要被读取、解析、执行的字符串，和真正的输入数据没有本质区别。正是这种&quot;代码也是数据&quot;的视角，让一台机器有了无限的可塑性，也直接预示了冯·诺依曼体系结构里&quot;指令和数据共享同一内存&quot;的设计。从计算器到智能手机，所有通用计算设备本质上都是通用图灵机的物理实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"停机问题-计算的硬边界\">停机问题：计算的硬边界</h2><p>有了&quot;程序即数据&quot;，图灵立刻用它构造出一个无解的问题——停机问题（Halting Problem）。它问的是：能不能写一个通用判定程序 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>，对任意机器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 和输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>，正确回答&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 上会停下来，还是永远跑下去&quot;？</p>\n<p>图灵的反证法（一种对角线论证）极其优美。假设这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 存在，就能用它造一台捣乱机器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 把某个机器的编码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle M \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span> 同时当成程序和输入，问 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle M \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span> 上会不会停&quot;；如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 说&quot;会停&quot;，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 就故意进入死循环；如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 说&quot;不停&quot;，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 就立刻停机——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 处处和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的预言对着干。</p>\n<p>现在把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 自己的编码喂给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，矛盾就爆发了：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 停机</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 不停机</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(\\langle D \\rangle) \\text{ 停机} \\iff D(\\langle D \\rangle) \\text{ 不停机}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">停机</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不停机</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个自相矛盾说明，最初假设的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 根本不可能存在。停机问题是不可判定的——它落在了可计算边界之外。这不是因为我们的算法不够聪明或硬件不够强，而是逻辑上的绝对不可能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对-hilbert-判定问题的否定回答\">对 Hilbert 判定问题的否定回答</h2><p>图灵造图灵机的真正目标，写在论文标题里：判定问题（Entscheidungsproblem）。这是大数学家希尔伯特（David Hilbert）提出的雄心——能否找到一个机械程序，对任何一阶逻辑命题判定它是否可证。希尔伯特相信数学终究是可以被算法穷尽的。</p>\n<p>图灵把判定问题归约到了停机问题：如果存在判定逻辑真伪的通用算法，就能用它解停机问题；可停机问题已被证明无解，所以那个算法不存在。希尔伯特的梦想就此破灭。几乎同时，美国逻辑学家邱奇（Alonzo Church）用完全不同的工具——λ 演算——得出了同样的否定结论。两人方法迥异却殊途同归，催生了著名的&quot;邱奇—图灵论题&quot;（Church–Turing Thesis）：凡是直觉上&quot;能用算法计算&quot;的函数，恰好就是图灵机能计算的函数。这条论题至今无法被证明（因为&quot;直觉上的算法&quot;本身无法形式化），却从未被推翻，成了计算理论的公理性基石。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>通用图灵机能把任意机器的描述当作数据来读取并模拟，是&quot;存储程序计算机&quot;的数学原型。</li>\n<li>它抹平了程序与数据的界限，赋予单台机器无限的可塑性——现代 CPU 加软件正是它的物理实现。</li>\n<li>停机问题用对角线自指构造出一个逻辑上无解的问题，划出了计算能力的硬边界。</li>\n<li>借此图灵否定了希尔伯特的判定问题，并与邱奇的 λ 演算殊途同归，共同确立了邱奇—图灵论题。</li>\n<li>关于&quot;机器思维到底有没有极限&quot;的延伸争论，见 <a href=\"../../controversies-and-appraisal/debates/limits-of-machine-thinking\">机器思维的边界</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"通用图灵机与计算的极限","id":"通用图灵机与计算的极限"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"程序即数据：通用性的关键","id":"程序即数据-通用性的关键"},{"level":2,"text":"停机问题：计算的硬边界","id":"停机问题-计算的硬边界"},{"level":2,"text":"对 Hilbert 判定问题的否定回答","id":"对-hilbert-判定问题的否定回答"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图灵机：一种计算的模型","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/core-contributions/the-turing-machine/a-model-of-computation"},"next":{"title":"计算机科学之父","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/core-contributions/founding-computer-science/the-father-of-computing"}}